Root cause:
The bug was caused by the removal of the parameter in the `onUpdateCheckpointDirection` method in a previous commit (91aca37), which led to a mismatch in method signatures. The method was expected to accept a `Position` object, but it was defined without any parameters, resulting in a build error when the method was called with an argument.



